From b358946bec5482263cd8809c70c517e439ca4778 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 01:24:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add openmw.net: TCP line client for global Lua scripts

- components/net: Boost.Asio line-based TCP client on a worker thread
- openmw.net package (global scripts): connect/disconnect/isConnected/send/encodeJson
- global engine handlers: onNetConnected, onNetDisconnected, onNetMessage
- unit tests (loopback) and docs

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
