+---
+-- Line-based TCP connection to an external server, for multiplayer and
+-- other out-of-process integrations.
+-- There is a single connection shared by all global scripts.
+-- Messages are UTF-8 strings terminated by a line break; the payload format is
+-- up to the script (see @{#net.encodeJson} and @{openmw.markup#markup.decodeYaml}, which also parses JSON).
+-- Connection progress and incoming data are delivered through the engine handlers
+-- `onNetConnected()`, `onNetDisconnected(reason)` and `onNetMessage(message)`.
+-- The connection is dropped when a game is unloaded.
+-- @context global
+-- @module net
+-- @usage local net = require('openmw.net')
+
+
+
+---
+-- Start connecting to a server. Does not block; the result is reported by
+-- the `onNetConnected` or `onNetDisconnected` handler. Replaces the current connection, if any.
+-- @function [parent=#net] connect
+-- @param #string host Host name or IP address.
+-- @param #number port TCP port, 1-65535.
+
+---
+-- Close the connection. `onNetDisconnected` is not called for a disconnect requested by a script.
+-- @function [parent=#net] disconnect
+
+---
+-- Whether the connection is established.
+-- @function [parent=#net] isConnected
+-- @return #boolean
+
+---
+-- Send a message to the server. A line break is appended.
+-- @function [parent=#net] send
+-- @param #string message Must not contain line breaks (`\r` or `\n`) and must be at most 1 MiB.
+-- @return #boolean `false` if not connected or the message was rejected.
+
+---
+-- Convert a Lua value to a JSON string, which contains no line breaks and can be passed to @{#net.send}.
+-- Supports nil, booleans, numbers, strings and tables; a table with keys 1..n is
+-- an array, any other table (with string keys) is an object. An empty table is an empty array.
+-- Throws an error for unsupported values (functions, userdata such as vectors and game objects),
+-- non-finite numbers, non-string object keys and cyclic tables.
+-- @function [parent=#net] encodeJson
+-- @param value Value to encode.
+-- @return #string
+
+return nil
-- 
